#: data/maps/FallarborTown_CozmosHouse/scripts.inc:67
msgctxt "FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Text_MeteoriteWillNeverBeMineNow"
msgid ""
"PROF. COZMO: Oh…\n"
"I never should have let myself be\l"
"conned into telling TEAM MAGMA where\l"
"you can find METEORITES…\p"
"That METEORITE from METEOR FALLS…\n"
"It's never going to be mine now…$"
msgstr ""
"宙石博士：唉……我真不该上当，\n"
"把能找到陨石的地方告诉熔岩队……\p"
"流星瀑布的那块陨石……\n"
"我现在再也得不到它了……$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_CozmosHouse/scripts.inc:75
msgctxt "FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Text_IsThatMeteoriteMayIHaveIt"
msgid ""
"Oh!\n"
"Hah?\p"
"That item…\p"
"Could it be?\p"
"Is it the METEORITE that TEAM MAGMA\n"
"took from METEOR FALLS?\p"
"Please, may I have it?\p"
"I'm not asking for it for free.\n"
"How about in exchange for this TM?$"
msgstr ""
"哦！咦？\p"
"那个东西……\p"
"难道说？\p"
"那是熔岩队从流星瀑布拿走的陨石吗？\p"
"拜托了，能把它给我吗？\p"
"我不是要你白送给我。\n"
"用这个招式学习器来交换怎么样？$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_CozmosHouse/scripts.inc:86
msgctxt "FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Text_PleaseUseThisTM"
msgid ""
"PROF. COZMO: This TM, it represents\n"
"my feeling of gratitude.\l"
"Please use it!$"
msgstr ""
"宙石博士：这个招式学习器代表了\n"
"我的感激之情。请用吧！$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_CozmosHouse/scripts.inc:91
msgctxt "FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Text_ReallyGoingToHelpMyResearch"
msgid ""
"PROF. COZMO: Oh, I can't believe it.\n"
"This is really, really great!\p"
"This is really going to help my research!$"
msgstr ""
"宙石博士：哦，真不敢相信。\n"
"这真是太、太好了！\p"
"这对我的研究会有很大帮助！$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_CozmosHouse/scripts.inc:96
msgctxt "FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Text_CrushedWithDisappointment"
msgid ""
"PROF. COZMO: Oh, but…\n"
"I'm crushed with disappointment…$"
msgstr ""
"宙石博士：哦，可是……\n"
"我真是太失望了……$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_CozmosHouse/scripts.inc:100
msgctxt "FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Text_MayIHaveMeteorite"
msgid ""
"PROF. COZMO: Please, may I have that\n"
"METEORITE?\p"
"I'm not asking for it for free.\n"
"How about in exchange for this TM?$"
msgstr ""
"宙石博士：拜托了，\n"
"能把那块陨石给我吗？\p"
"我不是要你白送给我。\n"
"用这个招式学习器来交换怎么样？$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_CozmosHouse/scripts.inc:106
msgctxt "FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Text_CozmoWentToMeteorFalls"
msgid ""
"PROF. COZMO went off to METEOR FALLS\n"
"on ROUTE 114 with some people from\l"
"TEAM MAGMA.$"
msgstr ""
"宙石博士和几个熔岩队的\n"
"人一起去了114号道路的流星瀑布。$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_CozmosHouse/scripts.inc:111
msgctxt "FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Text_FeelSorryForCozmo"
msgid ""
"Poor PROF. COZMO…\n"
"He's so depressed… I feel sorry for him.$"
msgstr ""
"可怜的宙石博士……\n"
"他好消沉……我真替他难过。$"

#: data/maps/FallarborTown_CozmosHouse/scripts.inc:115
msgctxt "FallarborTown_CozmosHouse_Text_CozmoIsSoHappy"
msgid ""
"Look at PROF. COZMO…\n"
"He's so happy! I think it's cute.$"
msgstr ""
"你看宙石博士……\n"
"他好开心！我觉得好可爱。$"
